[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1260493719","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791#issuecomment-1260493719","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791","id":1260493719,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5LIZuX","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-09-28T07:22:57Z","updated_at":"2022-09-28T07:22:57Z","body":"@s5uishida \r\n\r\nThe MME selects the SGW when the UE first connects and does not change thereafter. SGW relocation is supported only by X2 handover. Based on TS23.401, I implemented it that way.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if I misunderstood anything.\r\n\r\nThanks a lot!\r\nSukchan","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1260493719/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1261810806","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791#issuecomment-1261810806","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791","id":1261810806,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5LNbR2","user":{"login":"s5uishida","id":52230356,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjMwMzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52230356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida","html_url":"https://github.com/s5uishida","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-09-29T06:10:03Z","updated_at":"2022-09-29T06:10:03Z","body":"Hi @acetcom \r\n\r\nThank you very much for your reply!\r\n\r\nSince the UE sends `S1AP/NAS-EPS Attach request` via the eNodeB with TAC=2, I thought that the previous PDU and PFCP session would be deleted, and then the SGW-C selection would be done again.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1261810806/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1264366509","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791#issuecomment-1264366509","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791","id":1264366509,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5LXLOt","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-10-01T13:29:57Z","updated_at":"2022-10-01T13:29:57Z","body":"@s5uishida Have you ever seen this scanario in a standard document?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1264366509/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1264605692","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791#issuecomment-1264605692","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791","id":1264605692,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5LYFn8","user":{"login":"s5uishida","id":52230356,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjMwMzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52230356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida","html_url":"https://github.com/s5uishida","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-10-02T10:22:15Z","updated_at":"2022-10-02T10:22:15Z","body":"Hi @acetcom \r\n\r\nAccording to the following, it says to refer to 3GPP TS 29.303.\r\n```\r\n3GPP TS 29.244 Annex B.1 CP Selection Function -> B.1.1 General\r\n---\r\nThe SGW-C and PGW-C selection function shall follow the principles specified in 3GPP TS 29.303 [25] for the SGW\r\nand PGW selection functions without Control and User Plane Separation.\r\n```\r\nAs the following there was a description of TAU procedure when PGW is already selected.\r\n`3GPP TS 29.303 5.2 Procedures for Discovering and Selecting a SGW -> 5.2.1 General`\r\n\r\nIn my case, unlike TAU, I think it's just a case of connecting to a different TAC's eNodeB. I am concerned about the procedure when the UE once goes down and connects again from the eNodeB (TAC=1) to the eNodeB (TAC=2).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1264605692/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1264613580","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791#issuecomment-1264613580","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791","id":1264613580,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5LYHjM","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-10-02T10:59:45Z","updated_at":"2022-10-02T10:59:45Z","body":"@s5uishida \r\n\r\nThe SGW change in TAU/Handover are described in standard document. However, in the case of re-attach, there seems to be no mention in the spec. So, I'm just hesitating to implement Open5GS that way.\r\n\r\nIt seems that this feature will be considered later.\r\n\r\nThanks a lot!\r\nSukchan","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1264613580/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1264617778","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791#issuecomment-1264617778","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791","id":1264617778,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5LYIky","user":{"login":"s5uishida","id":52230356,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjMwMzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52230356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida","html_url":"https://github.com/s5uishida","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s5uishida/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-10-02T11:18:45Z","updated_at":"2022-10-02T11:18:45Z","body":"Hi @acetcom \r\n\r\nThank you very much for your reply.\r\n\r\nI understood.\r\n\r\nAlso, if I find a specification for this, I'll let you know.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\n--Shigeru","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1264617778/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1477030799","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791#issuecomment-1477030799","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1791","id":1477030799,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5YCbOP","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/gi